<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n741" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνωμ-οσύνη</span></b> , ἡ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>want of acquaintance
			with</i> a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				199d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>want of sense, folly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				896
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				175
			</span></i>; <i>senseless pride, arrogance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ba.</u>
				885
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς ἀ. τραπέσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.93
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγνωμοσύνῃ χρᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					5.83
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπ᾽ ἀγνωμοσύνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>want of feeling, unkindness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.252
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1266
				</span></i>
			(dub.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τύχης</span>, Lat.
				<i>iniquitas fortunae</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.207
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b> in pl.,
				<i>misunderstandings</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				2.5.6
			</span></i>.</div>
